OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrests and police officers
OL,4,Ahurt after brawl outside bare-knuckle
OL,5,Afighting event
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo men have been arrested and three
OL,8,Fpolice officers injured during a street
OL,9,Fdisturbance outside a bare-knuckle
OL,10,Ffighting championship in Glasgow.
OL,12,FFootage circulating on social media
OL,13,Fshows a group of men trading punches in
OL,14,Fthe street outside the Ovo Hydro where
OL,15,Fthe event was held on Saturday evening.
OL,17,FMore than 20 police vehicles and a
OL,18,Fpolice helicopter converged on the
OL,19,Farea. Three officers were hurt, two of
OL,20,Fthem requiring medical treatment, as
OL,21,Fthey responded to the disorder.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
