OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrests and police officers
OL,4,Ahurt after brawl outside bare-knuckle
OL,5,Afighting event
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland said two men, aged 32
OL,8,Fand 27, had been arrested and charged
OL,9,Fwith offences including assault,
OL,10,Fobstructing police and threatening and
OL,11,Fabusive behaviour.
